creatures:
- creatures:
  - creatures: 
    - name: Aboleth
      statblock:
        custom_statblock: |
          **Armor Class** 17  
          **Hit Points** 150 (rollable(dice=20d10 + 40,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
          **Speed** Walk 10 ft., Swim 40 ft.  
          **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Initiative) (17)
    
          ---
    
          |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
          |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
          |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=21)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=18)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
          |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=9)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=15)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
          |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=15)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=18)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|
    
          ---
    
          **Skills** History rollable(dice=1d20+12,label=+12,dicelabel=History Check), Perception rollable(dice=1d20+10,label=+10,dicelabel=Perception Check)  
          **Senses** darkvision 120 ft., Passive Perception 20  
          **Languages** Deep Speech; telepathy 120 ft.  
          **Challenge** 10 (5,900 XP)  
          **Proficiency Bonus** +4  
    
          ## Traits
    
          ***Amphibious.*** The aboleth can breathe air and water.
    
          ***Eldritch Restoration.*** If destroyed, the aboleth gains a new body in rollable(dice=5d10,dicelabel=Eldritch Restoration) days, reviving with all its ***Hit Points*** in the Far Realm or another location chosen by the DM.
    
          ***Legendary Resistance (3/Day, or 4/Day in Lair).*** If the aboleth fails a saving throw, it can choose to succeed instead.
    
          ***Mucus Cloud.*** While underwater, the aboleth is surrounded by mucus. *Constitution Saving Throw:* DC 14, each creature in a 5-foot ***Emanation*** originating from the aboleth at the end of the aboleth's turn. *Failure:* The target is cursed. Until the curse ends, the target's skin becomes slimy, the target can breathe air and water, and it can't regain ***Hit Points*** unless it is underwater.
    
          While the cursed creature is outside a body of water, the creature takes rollable(dice=1d12,dicelabel=Damage [Mucus Cloud]) Acid damage at the end of every 10 minutes unless moisture is applied to its skin before those minutes have passed.
    
          ***Probing Telepathy.*** If a creature the aboleth can see communicates telepathically with the aboleth, the aboleth learns the creature's greatest desires.
    
          ## Actions
    
          ***Multiattack.*** The aboleth makes two Tentacle attacks and uses either Consume Memories or Dominate Mind if available.
    
          ***Tentacle.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+9,label=+9,dicelabel=To Hit [Tentacle]), reach 15 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d6+5,dicelabel=Damage [Tentacle]) Bludgeoning damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the ***Grappled*** condition (escape DC 14) from one of four tentacles.
    
          ***Consume Memories.*** *Intelligence Saving Throw:* DC 16, one creature within 30 feet that is ***Charmed*** or ***Grappled*** by the aboleth. *Failure:* rollable(dice=3d6,dicelabel=Damage [Consume Memories]) Psychic damage. *Success:* Half damage. *Failure or Success:* The aboleth gains the target's memories if the target is a Humanoid and is reduced to 0 ***Hit Points*** by this action.
    
          ***Dominate Mind (2/Day).*** *Wisdom Saving Throw:* DC 16, one creature the aboleth can see within 30 feet. *Failure:* The target has the ***Charmed*** condition until the aboleth dies or is on a different plane of existence from the target. While ***Charmed***, the target acts as an ally to the aboleth and is under its control while within 60 feet of it. In addition, the aboleth and the target can communicate telepathically with each other over any distance.
    
          The target repeats the save whenever it takes damage as well as after every 24 hours it spends at least 1 mile away from the aboleth, ending the effect on itself on a success.
    
          ## Legendary Actions
    
          *Legendary Action Uses: 3 (4 in Lair). Immediately after another creature's turn, The Aboleth can expend a use to take one of the following actions. The Aboleth regains all expended uses at the start of each of its turns.*
    
          ***Lash.*** The aboleth makes one Tentacle attack.
    
          ***Psychic Drain.*** If the aboleth has at least one creature ***Charmed*** or ***Grappled***, it uses Consume Memories and regains 5 (rollable(dice=1d10,dicelabel=Psychic Drain)) ***Hit Points***.
    
        type: custom
      blurb: |
        # $[objectname]
    
        *Large Aberration, Lawful Evil*  
        **Challenge** 10
      subtype: npc
      id: srd2024aboleth
      status: 1
      order: 101
    - name: Chuul
      statblock:
        custom_statblock: |
          **Armor Class** 16  
          **Hit Points** 76 (rollable(dice=9d10 + 27,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
          **Speed** Walk 30 ft., Swim 30 ft.  
          **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Initiative) (10)
    
          ---
    
          |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
          |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
          |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=19)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=5)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-3,label=-3,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
          |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
          |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=5)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-3,label=-3,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|
    
          ---
    
          **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Perception Check)  
          **Damage Immunities** poison  
          **Condition Immunities** poisoned  
          **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 14  
          **Languages** understands Deep Speech but can't speak  
          **Challenge** 4 (1,100 XP)  
          **Proficiency Bonus** +2  
    
          ## Traits
    
          ***Amphibious.*** The chuul can breathe air and water.
    
          ***Sense Magic.*** The chuul senses magic within 120 feet of itself. This trait otherwise works like the [Detect Magic](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619097-detect-magic) spell but isn't itself magical.
    
          ## Actions
    
          ***Multiattack.*** The chuul makes two Pincer attacks and uses Paralyzing Tentacles.
    
          ***Pincer.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=To Hit [Pincer]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d10+4,dicelabel=Damage [Pincer]) Bludgeoning damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the ***Grappled*** condition (escape DC 14) from one of two pincers.
    
          ***Paralyzing Tentacles.*** *Constitution Saving Throw:* DC 13, one creature ***Grappled*** by the chuul. *Failure:* The target has the ***Poisoned*** condition and repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. After 1 minute, it succeeds automatically. While ***Poisoned***, the target has the ***Paralyzed*** condition.
    
        type: custom
      blurb: |
        # $[objectname]
    
        *Large Aberration, Chaotic Evil*  
        **Challenge** 4
      subtype: npc
      id: srd2024chuul
      status: 1
      order: 167
    - name: Cloaker
      statblock:
        custom_statblock: |
          **Armor Class** 14  
          **Hit Points** 91 (rollable(dice=14d10 + 14,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
          **Speed** Walk 10 ft., Fly 40 ft.  
          **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Initiative) (15)
    
          ---
    
          |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
          |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
          |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=17)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
          |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=15)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
          |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=7)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|
    
          ---
    
          **Skills** Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
          **Condition Immunities** frightened  
          **Senses** darkvision 120 ft., Passive Perception 12  
          **Languages** Deep Speech, Undercommon  
          **Challenge** 8 (3,900 XP)  
          **Proficiency Bonus** +3  
    
          ## Traits
    
          ***Light Sensitivity.*** While in ***Bright Light***, the cloaker has ***Disadvantage*** on attack rolls.
    
          ## Actions
    
          ***Multiattack.*** The cloaker makes one Attach attack and two Tail attacks.
    
          ***Attach.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=To Hit [Attach]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=3d6+3,dicelabel=Damage [Attach]) Piercing damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, the cloaker attaches to it. While the cloaker is attached, the target has the ***Blinded*** condition, and the cloaker can't make Attach attacks against other targets. In addition, the cloaker halves the damage it takes (round down), and the target takes the same amount of damage.
    
          The cloaker can detach itself by spending 5 feet of movement. The target or a creature within 5 feet of it can take an action to try to detach the cloaker, doing so by succeeding on a DC 14 Strength (***Athletics***) check.
    
          ***Tail.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=To Hit [Tail]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d10+3,dicelabel=Damage [Tail]) Slashing damage.
    
          ## Bonus Actions
    
          ***Moan.*** *Wisdom Saving Throw:* DC 13, each creature in a 60-foot ***Emanation*** originating from the cloaker. *Failure:* The target has the ***Frightened*** condition until the end of the cloaker's next turn. *Success:* The target is immune to this cloaker's Moan for the next 24 hours.
    
          ***Phantasms (Recharge after a Short or Long Rest).*** The cloaker casts the [Mirror Image](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619060-mirror-image) spell, requiring no spell components and using Wisdom as the spellcasting ability. The spell ends early if the cloaker starts or ends its turn in ***Bright Light***.
    
          At will: [Mirror Image](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619060-mirror-image)  
    
        type: custom
      blurb: |
        # $[objectname]
    
        *Large Aberration, Chaotic Neutral*  
        **Challenge** 8
      subtype: npc
      id: srd2024cloaker
      status: 1
      order: 169
    - name: Darkmantle
      statblock:
        custom_statblock: |
          **Armor Class** 11  
          **Hit Points** 22 (rollable(dice=5d6 + 5,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
          **Speed** Walk 10 ft., Fly 30 ft.  
          **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Initiative) (13)
    
          ---
    
          |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
          |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
          |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=2)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-4,label=-4,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
          |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
          |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=5)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-3,label=-3,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|
    
          ---
    
          **Skills** Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
          **Senses** blindsight 60 ft., Passive Perception 10  
          **Languages** -  
          **Challenge** 1/2 (100 XP)  
          **Proficiency Bonus** +2  
    
          ## Actions
    
          ***Crush.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Crush]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d6+3,dicelabel=Damage [Crush]) Bludgeoning damage, and the darkmantle attaches to the target. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature and the darkmantle had ***Advantage*** on the attack roll, it covers the target, which has the ***Blinded*** condition and is suffocating while the darkmantle is attached in this way.
    
          While attached to a target, the darkmantle can attack only the target but has ***Advantage*** on its attack rolls. Its ***Speed*** becomes 0, it can't benefit from any bonus to its ***Speed***, and it moves with the target.
    
          A creature can take an action to try to detach the darkmantle from itself, doing so with a successful DC 13 Strength (***Athletics***) check. On its turn, the darkmantle can detach itself by using 5 feet of movement.
    
          ***Darkness Aura (1/Day).*** Magical ***Darkness*** fills a 15-foot ***Emanation*** originating from the darkmantle. This effect lasts while the darkmantle maintains concentration on it, up to 10 minutes. Darkvision can't penetrate this area, and no light can illuminate it.
    
        type: custom
      blurb: |
        # $[objectname]
    
        *Small Aberration, Unaligned*  
        **Challenge** 1/2
      subtype: npc
      id: srd2024darkmantle
      status: 1
      order: 180
    - name: Gibbering Mouther
      statblock:
        custom_statblock: |
          **Armor Class** 9  
          **Hit Points** 52 (rollable(dice=7d8 + 21,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
          **Speed** Walk 20 ft., Swim 20 ft.  
          **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20-1,label=-1,dicelabel=Initiative) (9)
    
          ---
    
          |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
          |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
          |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=3)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-4,label=-4,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
          |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=8)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-1,label=-1,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
          |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=6)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|
    
          ---
    
          **Condition Immunities** prone  
          **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 10  
          **Languages** -  
          **Challenge** 2 (450 XP)  
          **Proficiency Bonus** +2  
    
          ## Traits
    
          ***Aberrant Ground.*** The ground in a 10-foot ***Emanation*** originating from the mouther is ***Difficult Terrain***.
    
          ***Gibbering.*** The mouther babbles incoherently while it doesn't have the ***Incapacitated*** condition. *Wisdom Saving Throw:* DC 10, any creature that starts its turn within 20 feet of the mouther while it is babbling. *Failure:* The target rolls rollable(dice=1d8,dicelabel=Gibbering) to determine what it does during the current turn:
    
          > ***1-4.*** The target does nothing.
          >
          > ***5-6.*** The target takes no action or ***Bonus Action*** and uses all its movement to move in a random direction.
          >
          > ***7-8.*** The target makes a melee attack against a randomly determined creature within its reach or does nothing if it can't make such an attack.
    
          ## Actions
    
          ***Bite.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=To Hit [Bite]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d6,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Piercing damage. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature, it has the ***Prone*** condition. The target dies if it is reduced to 0 ***Hit Points*** by this attack. Its body is then absorbed into the mouther, leaving only equipment behind.
    
          ***Blinding Spittle (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 5-6,dicelabel=Recharge [Blinding Spittle])).*** *Dexterity Saving Throw:* DC 10, each creature in a 10-foot-radius ***Sphere*** centered on a point within 30 feet. *Failure:* rollable(dice=2d6,dicelabel=Damage [Blinding Spittle]) Radiant damage, and the target has the ***Blinded*** condition until the end of the mouther's next turn.
    
        type: custom
      blurb: |
