          **Skills** Athletics rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Athletics Check), Perception rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Perception Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
          **Senses** blindsight 30 ft., Passive Perception 13  
          **Languages** -  
          **Challenge** 1/4 (50 XP)  
          **Proficiency Bonus** +2  
    
          ## Actions
    
          ***Bone Cudgel.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Bone Cudgel]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d6+3,dicelabel=Damage [Bone Cudgel]) Bludgeoning damage plus rollable(dice=1d4,dicelabel=Damage [Bone Cudgel]) Psychic damage.
    
