        # $[objectname]
    
        *Medium Aberration, Neutral Evil*  
        **Challenge** 1/4
      subtype: npc
      id: srd2024grimlock
      status: 1
      order: 256
    - name: Otyugh
      statblock:
        custom_statblock: |
          **Armor Class** 14  
          **Hit Points** 104 (rollable(dice=11d10 + 44,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
          **Speed** 30 ft.  
          **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Initiative) (10)
    
          ---
    
          |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
          |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
          |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=6)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
          |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
          |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=19)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=6)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|
    
          ---
    
          **Senses** darkvision 120 ft., Passive Perception 11  
          **Languages** Otyugh; telepathy 120 ft. (doesn't allow the receiving creature to respond telepathically)  
          **Challenge** 5 (1,800 XP)  
          **Proficiency Bonus** +3  
    
          ## Actions
    
          ***Multiattack.*** The otyugh makes one Bite attack and two Tentacle attacks.
    
          ***Bite.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=To Hit [Bite]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d8+3,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Piercing damage, and the target has the ***Poisoned*** condition. Whenever the ***Poisoned*** target finishes a ***Long Rest***, it is subjected to the following effect. *Constitution Saving Throw:* DC 15. *Failure:* The target's ***Hit Point*** maximum decreases by 5 (rollable(dice=1d10,dicelabel=Bite)) and doesn't return to normal until the ***Poisoned*** condition ends on the target. *Success:* The ***Poisoned*** condition ends.
    
          ***Tentacle.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=To Hit [Tentacle]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d8+3,dicelabel=Damage [Tentacle]) Piercing damage. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature, it has the ***Grappled*** condition (escape DC 13) from one of two tentacles.
    
          ***Tentacle Slam.*** *Constitution Saving Throw:* DC 14, each creature ***Grappled*** by the otyugh. *Failure:* rollable(dice=3d8+3,dicelabel=Damage [Tentacle Slam]) Bludgeoning damage, and the target has the ***Stunned*** condition until the start of the otyugh's next turn. *Success:* Half damage only.
    
        type: custom
      blurb: |
        # $[objectname]
    
        *Large Aberration, Neutral*  
        **Challenge** 5
      subtype: npc
      id: srd2024otyugh
      status: 1
      order: 316
    - name: Roper
      statblock:
        custom_statblock: |
          **Armor Class** 20  
          **Hit Points** 93 (rollable(dice=11d10 + 33,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
          **Speed** Walk 10 ft., Climb 20 ft.  
          **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Initiative) (15)
    
          ---
    
          |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
          |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
          |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=18)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=7)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
          |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=8)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-1,label=-1,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
          |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=17)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=6)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|
    
          ---
    
          **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Perception Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
          **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 16  
          **Languages** -  
          **Challenge** 5 (1,800 XP)  
          **Proficiency Bonus** +3  
    
          ## Traits
    
          ***Spider Climb.*** The roper can climb difficult surfaces, including along ceilings, without needing to make an ability check.
    
          ## Actions
    
          ***Multiattack.*** The roper makes two Tentacle attacks, uses Reel, and makes two Bite attacks.
    
          ***Bite.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=To Hit [Bite]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=3d8+4,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Piercing damage.
    
          ***Tentacle.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=To Hit [Tentacle]), reach 60 ft. *Hit:* The target has the ***Grappled*** condition (escape DC 14) from one of six tentacles, and the target has the ***Poisoned*** condition until the grapple ends.
    
          The tentacle can be damaged, freeing a creature it has ***Grappled*** when destroyed (AC 20, HP 10, ***Immunity*** to Poison and Psychic damage). Damaging the tentacle deals no damage to the roper, and a destroyed tentacle regrows at the start of the roper's next turn.
    
          ***Reel.*** The roper pulls each creature ***Grappled*** by it up to 30 feet straight toward it.
    
        type: custom
