          ## Traits
    
          ***Beast of Burden.*** The mule counts as one size larger for the purpose of determining its carrying capacity.
    
          ## Actions
    
          ***Hooves.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=To Hit [Hooves]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d4+2,dicelabel=Damage [Hooves]) Bludgeoning damage.
    
