          ***Hooves.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=To Hit [Hooves]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d4+4,dicelabel=Damage [Hooves]) Bludgeoning damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature and the horse moved 20+ feet straight toward it immediately before the hit, the target takes an extra rollable(dice=2d4,dicelabel=Damage [Hooves]) Bludgeoning damage and has the ***Prone*** condition.
    
