            ***Multiattack.*** The dragon makes three Rend attacks.
      
            ***Rend.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+11,label=+11,dicelabel=To Hit [Rend]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d6+6,dicelabel=Damage [Rend]) Slashing damage plus rollable(dice=1d8,dicelabel=Damage [Rend]) Cold damage.
      
            ***Cold Breath (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 5-6,dicelabel=Recharge [Cold Breath])).*** *Constitution Saving Throw:* DC 19, each creature in a 60-foot ***Cone***. *Failure:* rollable(dice=12d8,dicelabel=Damage [Cold Breath]) Cold damage. *Success:* Half damage.
      
            ## Legendary Actions
      
            *Legendary Action Uses: 3 (4 in Lair). Immediately after another creature's turn, The Adult White Dragon can expend a use to take one of the following actions. The Adult White Dragon regains all expended uses at the start of each of its turns.*
      
            ***Freezing Burst.*** *Constitution Saving Throw:* DC 14, each creature in a 30-foot-radius ***Sphere*** centered on a point the dragon can see within 120 feet. *Failure:* rollable(dice=2d6,dicelabel=Damage [Freezing Burst]) Cold damage, and the target's ***Speed*** is 0 until the end of the target's next turn. *Failure or Success:* The dragon can't take this action again until the start of its next turn.
      
            ***Pounce.*** The dragon moves up to half its ***Speed***, and it makes one Rend attack.
      
            ***Frightful Presence.*** The dragon casts [Fear](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618872-fear), requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 14). The dragon can't take this action again until the start of its next turn.
      
