            **Speed** Walk 30 ft., Fly 60 ft.  
            **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Initiative) (17)
      
            ---
      
            |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
            |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
            |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=18)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
            |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
            |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=18)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=18)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|
      
            ---
      
            **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Perception Check), Persuasion rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=Persuasion Check)  
            **Damage Resistances** cold  
            **Damage Immunities** fire, poison  
            **Condition Immunities** poisoned  
            **Senses** truesight 120 ft., Passive Perception 16  
            **Languages** Infernal; telepathy 120 ft.  
            **Challenge** 12 (8,400 XP)  
            **Proficiency Bonus** +4  
      
            ## Traits
      
            ***Diabolical Restoration.*** If the erinyes dies outside the Nine Hells, its body disappears in sulfurous smoke, and it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its ***Hit Points*** somewhere in the Nine Hells.
      
            ***Magic Resistance.*** The erinyes has ***Advantage*** on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
      
            ***Magic Rope.*** The erinyes has a magic rope. While bearing it, the erinyes can use the Entangling Rope action. The rope has AC 20, HP 90, and ***Immunity*** to Poison and Psychic damage. The rope turns to dust if reduced to 0 ***Hit Points***, if it is 5+ feet away from the erinyes for 1 hour or more, or if the erinyes dies. If the rope is damaged or destroyed, the erinyes can fully restore it when finishing a ***Short*** or ***Long Rest***.
      
            ## Actions
      
            ***Multiattack.*** The erinyes makes three Withering Sword attacks and can use Entangling Rope.
      
            ***Withering Sword.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=To Hit [Withering Sword]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d8+4,dicelabel=Damage [Withering Sword]) Slashing damage plus rollable(dice=2d10,dicelabel=Damage [Withering Sword]) Necrotic damage.
      
            ***Entangling Rope (Requires Magic Rope).*** *Strength Saving Throw:* DC 16, one creature the erinyes can see within 120 feet. *Failure:* rollable(dice=4d6,dicelabel=Damage [Entangling Rope]) Force damage, and the target has the ***Restrained*** condition until the rope is destroyed, the erinyes uses a ***Bonus Action*** to release the target, or the erinyes uses Entangling Rope again.
      
            ## Reactions
      
            ***Parry.*** *Trigger:* The erinyes is hit by a melee attack roll while holding a weapon. *Response:* The erinyes adds 4 to its AC against that attack, possibly causing it to miss.
      
