          **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Initiative) (11)
    
          ---
    
          |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
          |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
          |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
          |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=15)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
          |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=15)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|
    
