          |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
          |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=8)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-1,label=-1,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|
    
          ---
    
          **Gear** chain shirt, spear  
          **Senses** Passive Perception 10  
          **Languages** Common  
          **Challenge** 1/8 (25 XP)  
          **Proficiency Bonus** +2  
    
          ## Traits
    
          ***Pack Tactics.*** The warrior has ***Advantage*** on an attack roll against a creature if at least one of the warrior's allies is within 5 feet of the creature and the ally doesn't have the ***Incapacitated*** condition.
    
          ## Actions
    
          ***Spear.*** *Melee or Ranged Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=To Hit [Spear]), reach 5 ft. or range 20/60 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d6+1,dicelabel=Damage [Spear]) Piercing damage.
    
