          |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=2)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-4,label=-4,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
          |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=8)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-1,label=-1,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=8)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-1,label=-1,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
          |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=15)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=7)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|
    
          ---
    
          **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 9  
          **Languages** -  
          **Challenge** 3 (700 XP)  
          **Proficiency Bonus** +2  
    
          ## Actions
    
          ***Bite.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Bite]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d6+3,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Piercing damage plus rollable(dice=2d6,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Poison damage.
    
          ## Bonus Actions
    
          ***Petrifying Gaze (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 4-6,dicelabel=Recharge [Petrifying Gaze])).*** *Constitution Saving Throw:* DC 12, each creature in a 30-foot ***Cone***. If the basilisk sees its reflection within the ***Cone***, the basilisk must make this save. *First Failure:* The target has the ***Restrained*** condition and repeats the save at the end of its next turn if it is still ***Restrained***, ending the effect on itself on a success. *Second Failure:* The target has the ***Petrified*** condition instead of the ***Restrained*** condition.
    
