          **Hit Points** 36 (rollable(dice=8d8,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
          **Speed** 30 ft.  
          **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Initiative) (13)
    
          ---
    
          |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
          |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
          |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
          |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=17)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
          |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=8)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-1,label=-1,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|
    
          ---
    
          **Damage Resistances** necrotic  
          **Damage Immunities** poison  
          **Condition Immunities** charmed, exhaustion, poisoned  
          **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 10  
          **Languages** Common  
          **Challenge** 2 (450 XP)  
          **Proficiency Bonus** +2  
    
          ## Traits
    
          ***Stench.*** *Constitution Saving Throw:* DC 10, any creature that starts its turn in a 5-foot ***Emanation*** originating from the ghast. *Failure:* The target has the ***Poisoned*** condition until the start of its next turn. *Success:* The target is immune to this ghast's Stench for 24 hours.
    
          ## Actions
    
          ***Bite.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Bite]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d8+3,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Piercing damage plus rollable(dice=2d8,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Necrotic damage.
    
          ***Claw.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Claw]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d6+3,dicelabel=Damage [Claw]) Slashing damage. If the target is a non-Undead creature, it is subjected to the following effect. *Constitution Saving Throw:* DC 10. *Failure:* The target has the ***Paralyzed*** condition until the end of its next turn.
    
