          ## Actions
    
          ***Shortsword.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Shortsword]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d6+3,dicelabel=Damage [Shortsword]) Piercing damage.
    
          ***Shortbow.*** *Ranged Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Shortbow]), range 80/320 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d6+3,dicelabel=Damage [Shortbow]) Piercing damage.
    
